=2 Walkthrough
* As a White Mage, talk to {n:Narcheral} (M-6) upstairs in the cathedral in {z:Northern San d'Oria} to get the quest.
** **__Note: You can do the rest of the quest on any job.**__
* Head to (B-8) (Secret Beach) in {z:Valkurm Dunes}.
** The {p:Survival Guide} teleport to {z:Gustav Tunnel}, then walking out will bring you directly next to the spawn point.
* Between 18:00 and 5:00 a **???** will appear near the {p:Song Runes}. Click on it to spawn {m:Marchelute}.
** If another player killed {m:Marchelute} recently, a few minutes have to pass before {m:Marchelute} will spawn again.
